((intellect3-science
  ((question . "An inclined plane forms an angle of \\( 30^\\circ \\) with the horizontal. A body of mass \\( M = 2 \\) kg rests on it. A string passing over a pulley forms an angle of \\( 45^\\circ \\) with the plane. For what value of the mass \\( m \\) attached to the other end of the string are these bodies in equilibrium? Find the normal force of the body acting on the plane. Friction should be neglected.")
