  ((question . "Find the coefficient \\( \\sigma \\) of surface tension of a liquid if it rises to a height \\( h = 32.6 \\text{ mm} \\) in a capillary of diameter \\( D = 1 \\text{ mm} \\). The density of the liquid is \\( \\delta = 1 \\text{ g cm}^{-3} \\), and the edge angle of the meniscus is zero.")
    (answer . "80")
