    (difficulty . "0.062"))
  ((question . "Given a positive integer `n`, break it into the sum of at least two positive integers and maximize the product of those integers. Return the maximum product you can get. For example, given `n = 2`, return `1` (2 = 1 + 1); given `n = 10`, return `36` (10 = 3 + 3 + 4).")
    (answer . "36")
