  ((question . "After training the network on the \"all.pat\" file (which includes one exception pattern, 147 → 147, and 17 regular patterns following the rule of 78), what is the network’s most probable response to the input pattern 147? Explain why the network loses the ability to produce 147 as its response. What changes occur in the weights that were previously responsible for producing 147 from 147?")
    (answer . "148")
    (domain . "cs")
